 <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="49" Name="List Table 4 Accent 5"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="50" Name="List Table 5 Dark Accent 5"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="51" Name="List Table 6 Colorful Accent 5"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="52" Name="List Table 7 Colorful Accent 5"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="46" Name="List Table 1 Light Accent 6"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="47" Name="List Table 2 Accent 6"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="48" Name="List Table 3 Accent 6"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="49" Name="List Table 4 Accent 6"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="50" Name="List Table 5 Dark Accent 6"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="51" Name="List Table 6 Colorful Accent 6"/> <w:LsdException Locked="false" Priority="52" Name="List Table 7 Colorful Accent 6"/> </w:LatentStyles> </xml><![endif]--> <!--[if gte mso 10]> <style> /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:"Table Normal"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:""; mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-para-margin-top:0cm; mso-para-margin-right:0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom:8.0pt; mso-para-margin-left:0cm; line-height:107%; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;} </style> <![endif]--> <!--StartFragment--> <p style="text-align:justify"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><!--[endif]--><b>The activities done in 2Q<o:p></o:p></b></p> <p style="text-align:justify">1.RWVCA was provided one coaster for transportation our partners during the 32nd Commemoration of the Genocide against the Tutsi in 1994</p><p style="text-align:justify">2.We visited members across 12 districts: Kamonyi, Muhanga, Huye, Nyamagabe, Rusizi, Nyamasheke, Karongi, Rubavu, Nyabihu, Musanze, Gasabo, and Nyagatare.</p><p style="text-align:justify">3.Membership recovery, 20 members totaled 7,375,000 RWF, and two new members joined the Association.</p> <p style="text-align:justify">4.We monitored the implementation of desk repair activities in Bugesera, Rubavu, and Musanze Districts, and also followed up on the new desks produced in Gasabo and Kicukiro.<o:p></o:p></p><p style="text-align:justify">5.<span style="text-align: start;">During this quarter, we have already purchased food, and hygiene supplies worth 2,326,520 RWF, and we plan to close the quarter with total expenditures of 2,826,520 RWF, compared to the 6 million RWF that had been budgeted.</span></p><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="text-align: start;">6.</span><span style="text-align: start;">Through the Irembo system, we requested a reduction in electricity costs for five members.</span><span style="text-align: start;">We are still waiting for feedback.</span></p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--> <p style="text-align:justify"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <!--[endif]--><b>Planned Activities for Q3</b><o:p></o:p></p> <ol start="1" type="1"> <li style=" text-align:justify">We will continue visiting both existing members and prospective members.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=" text-align:justify">We will continue collecting contributions from members who have not yet paid.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=" text-align:justify">We will organize a meeting with the presidents of the ICPCs.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=" text-align:justify">We will conduct training sessions for women and youth on business and financial management.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=" text-align:justify">We will continue registering all operators engaged in the tree business value chain in Rwanda.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=" text-align:justify">We will collaborate with colleagues on the RPL program.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=" text-align:justify">While we receive a purchase order for desks, I will monitor its implementation.<o:p></o:p></li><li style=" text-align:justify"><!--StartFragment-->We will continue advocating for a reduction in electricity costs for members engaged in carpentry business.<!--EndFragment--></li> </ol> <!--EndFragment--></div><!--EndFragment--><div><br></div><div>Thank you.</div>	general	1	\N	7	2026-06-15 14:01:58+00	2026-06-15 14:01:58+00	\N	\N	\N	\N
169	Notification of Sick Leave	<!--StartFragment--><div style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);">Dear Hr</div><div style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);">I am writing to inform you that I have been granted a 5-day medical leave due to illness, starting from June 16, 2026, until June 20, 2026.</div><div style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);">Please find attached the official medical certificate.</div><div style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);">I will ensure to catch up on any pending tasks as soon as I return. Thank you for your understanding.</div><div style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);">Best regards,</div><div style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68);">Moses Niyitegeka</div><!--EndFragment-->	general	1	\N	101	2026-06-16 09:42:45+00	2026-06-16 09:42:45+00	\N	\N	uploads/communications/1781595765_092c1b386ee6d99c.pdf	
170	Impamvu nakoze refund	Mwiriwe neza? Uyu munsi nakoze refund ya facture ifite nimero ya 802&amp;813 nayikoze kubera ko umuclient yazanye imbaho yakuramo nkeya akazanga.	general	4,3,7	\N	74	2026-06-17 20:32:46+00	2026-06-17 20:32:46+00	\N	\N	\N	\N
