176	lnvoice issue	Mwiriwe neza,<div><br></div><div>lmpamvu: gusaba gukora refund.</div><div><br></div><div>Mbandikiye mbasaba ko mwa nyemerera gukora refund ya fagitire yakozwe kuwa 17 Kamena 2026.</div><div><br></div><div>Nakoze fagitire yirusizi nkuko mwabinsabyeko nabamfasha umukozi uhakorera, gukora fagitire,</div><div>ni mururwo rwego nakoze fagitire ariko isohoka yanditseho inshuro ebyiri (2) zimbaho zagombaga kujyaho.</div><div><br></div><div>nukuvugango yagombaga kuba iriho imbaho magana atandatu 600 isohoka iriho imbaho magana atandatu 600 inshuro ebyiri,&nbsp; ziba igihumbi magana abiri 1200.</div><div><br></div><div>Mwanyemerera kuyikorera refund tugakora indi fagitire yanditse neza.</div><div><br></div><div>Murakoze cyane, Mugire amahoro.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Anastase NTIRENGANYA</div><div><br></div><div>Site: Karongi - Rutsiro</div>	general	7,3,73	\N	112	2026-06-19 23:14:01+00	2026-06-19 23:14:01+00	\N	\N	uploads/communications/1781903641_05361fe32f729587.jpeg	
