182	ADDITIONAL TRANSPORTATION COST	Good afternoon, <div>I hope you are doing well.</div><div>I am writing to inform you about the additional transportation cost you asked me to calculate. after reviewing my daily expenses. I found that extra cost is 2,900RWF per day.</div><div>Previously, when I was travelling to Gisozi I spent 1,250RWF per day on transport each day.</div><div>However, here in Bishenyi my daily transportation is 4,150RWF per day. This is because I have to take motorcycle taxi for 3,000RWF every morning, I can't take bus because here at Bishenyi start to unload timber at</div><div>6:00 am.</div><div>Therefore, the additional transportation cost amount is 2900RWF per day.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for understanding.</div>	general	1	\N	74	2026-07-01 20:45:27+00	2026-07-01 20:45:27+00	\N	\N	\N	\N
