98	Mandatory Prior Approval for All Activities	<p class="ql-align-justify">Dear All staff,</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify">This is a reminder that no activity may be initiated or implemented without prior approval from the Association’s management. This requirement applies to all departments, projects, and engagements undertaken on behalf of the Association.</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify">Please note the following:</p><ol><li class="ql-align-justify">&nbsp;Any activity carried out without prior approval will not be eligible for budget allocation or reimbursement<strong>. In such cases, the individual responsible will be required to cover all related costs personally.</strong></li><li class="ql-align-justify">&nbsp;Proceeding without approval will be considered a failure to follow the Association’s rules and regulations, which may lead to further administrative action as outlined in our internal policies.</li></ol><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify">This measure is not intended to limit initiative, but to ensure proper coordination, accountability, and alignment with our strategic priorities. Your cooperation is essential in maintaining order, transparency, and responsible use of resources.</p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Please note that this directive must be followed without exception.</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify">Let us all continue to uphold the standards that strengthen our Association.</p><p class="ql-align-justify">Kind regards,</p><p class="ql-align-justify">ED</p>	general	4,1,2,3,6,7,8,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,101,102,103,104,105,106,107,108,109,110,112,113	2,76,105,108,77,5,7	5	2026-04-10 17:19:11+00	2026-09-16 08:24:13.722+00	\N	\N	\N	\N
