2	Soft Nest sofa	Sofa Light Business Ltd	7SEATERs SOFA WITH coffe table :Components: Frame assembled in marine boards(muba) or plywood, eucalyptus wood, pine wood, springs, and high-quality fabric material, high-quality mattress that lasts long. The client chooses the fabric material for covering to satisfy their color and texture needs. COFFEE TABLE made in Mdf with the top of white plastic marble, plastic marbles are in different colors. EXCEPTION: A client may choose furniture product design and materials according to his/her choice. Therefore, the Prices may change depending on specifications.	0788689926	Kigali Rwanda - Kinamba / Remera	https://sofalight.rw/shop/product.php?pro=429	info@sofalight.rw	uploads/products/product_2_image1_69296fe53fe67.jpeg	uploads/products/product_2_image2_69296fe540037.jpeg	uploads/products/product_2_image3_69296fe540179.jpeg	1	2025-10-23 09:53:35+00	2025-11-28 09:48:21+00
