708	KUGARAGAZA ISHUSHO YUKO IMASHINI IHAGAZE/ IMEZE NYUMA YO KUVA KU MUSUPPLIER	Activity	<b>Mwiriwe neza Logistic (Emmy),<br></b>Ndizera mu meze neza,<br>Nifuzaga gutanga ishusho ngari y'iyi mashini (laptop-<b>HP ELITEBOOK 830 G6</b>) ifite SN# 5CG01524PQ na nimero iranga igikoresho ariyo&nbsp;<b>&nbsp;MRO-LPT-006</b>&nbsp;mwari mwampaye ngo ikorerwe isuzumwa niba ikora neza cyangwa se ntakindi kibazo ifite nyuma yuko ivuye ku musupplier wari wazitanze kuri RWVCA nyuma ikaza kugira ikibazo.<br>Ubu imashini irako neza, tugendeye ku isuzuma ryakozwe ritandukanye, harimo kuba ifata murandasi, kub ayihuta mu mikorere, kuba isohora amajwi neza, kuba ibika kandi yinjiza umuriro, kuba na software issues zihari, ndetse amadrivers akaba arimo kandi akora.<br><br>Murakoze.	2026-06-02	2026-06-02	2	2026-06-03 12:31:56+00	2026-06-03 12:31:56+00	09:00:00	\N	RWVCA Head Office
